{"seq":2,"slug":"comparable-defense-evidence","title":"可比性分析与抗辩证据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/transfer-pricing-tax-audit-defense/tax-audit-defense/comparable-defense-evidence","wordCount":2056,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"可比性分析与抗辩证据\">可比性分析与抗辩证据</h1><p>转让定价抗辩的技术核心只有一个问题：你用的那组可比公司，税务机关凭什么接受？很多案件的失利不是因为利润率数字不好看，而是因为<strong>样本的产生过程无法复现</strong>——三方数据库的检索条件没留档、剔除理由只存在于某位同事的记忆里、候选名单的来源与版本对不上。税务机关一旦要求重放这个过程而你不能重放，整个方法的可靠性就被削弱了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-证据链的三个层次\">核心概念：证据链的三个层次</h2><p>可比性分析的证据不是一堆文件，而是一条有依赖顺序的链条。链条上任何一环断裂，后面的论证都会失去支撑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[第一层: 方法选择依据] --&gt; B[第二层: 样本产生过程]&#10;  B --&gt; C[第三层: 差异调整与区间]&#10;  C --&gt; D[受控结果比对]&#10;  D --&gt; E{落在区间内?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[不予调整]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[调整到约定点]&#10;  A --&gt; H[最优方法规则&lt;br/&gt;为何此方法最可靠]&#10;  B --&gt; I[检索条件/剔除理由/版本]&#10;  C --&gt; J[差异计量与调整依据]\">graph TD\n  A[第一层: 方法选择依据] --&gt; B[第二层: 样本产生过程]\n  B --&gt; C[第三层: 差异调整与区间]\n  C --&gt; D[受控结果比对]\n  D --&gt; E{落在区间内?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[不予调整]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[调整到约定点]\n  A --&gt; H[最优方法规则&lt;br/&gt;为何此方法最可靠]\n  B --&gt; I[检索条件/剔除理由/版本]\n  C --&gt; J[差异计量与调整依据]</pre><p><strong>第一层是方法选择依据</strong>。最优方法规则要求方法必须是&quot;对独立交易结果的最可靠度量&quot;，且不存在方法的固定优先顺序（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/26/1.482-1\">26 CFR § 1.482-1</a>）。抗辩中必须能说明：为什么在可选方法中选了这个。常用的论证结构是比较不同方法在可比性、数据质量、假设可靠性三个维度上的表现。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层是样本产生过程</strong>。这是证据链中最容易断裂、也最容易被攻击的一环。它要求把从数据库到最终样本的每一步筛选都变成可重放的记录。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层是差异调整与区间</strong>。法规区分两种情形：重大差异可被识别并可靠调整时，区间由所有合格可比结果构成；可比性不完整时使用统计区间，法规规定的常规选择是<strong>四分位区间（第 25 到第 75 百分位）</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/26/1.482-1\">26 CFR § 1.482-1</a>）。抗辩中必须明确说明落入哪一种，因为选择统计区间等于承认可比性不完整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"样本筛选的可重放记录\">样本筛选的可重放记录</h2><p>可重放的关键在于：<strong>用同一条检索条件、同一个数据版本，应当得到同一份候选名单</strong>。因此需要固定三样东西：数据源与版本、检索条件、以及逐条剔除的理由。</p>\n<h3 id=\"筛选日志的表结构\">筛选日志的表结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE comparable_screen_run (&#10;  run_id         TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  policy_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  data_source    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  data_version   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  run_at         TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,&#10;  executed_by    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  hits_raw       INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  hits_final     INTEGER NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE comparable_candidate (&#10;  run_id         TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES comparable_screen_run(run_id),&#10;  company_id     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  screen_step    SMALLINT NOT NULL,&#10;  decision       TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (decision IN (&#39;keep&#39;,&#39;reject&#39;)),&#10;  reason_code    TEXT,&#10;  detail         TEXT,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (run_id, company_id, screen_step)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> comparable_screen_run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  run_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  policy_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  data_source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  data_version   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  run_at         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  executed_by    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hits_raw       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hits_final     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> comparable_candidate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  run_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> comparable_screen_run(run_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  company_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  screen_step    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'keep'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reject'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detail         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (run_id, company_id, screen_step)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>表设计的要点是 <code>data_version</code> 与 <code>reason_code</code>。前者固定了样本的可复现性——三方数据库的内容会随时间变化，不记录版本就无法解释为什么今天重跑得不到同样的名单。后者把剔除理由变成受控编码，避免&quot;业务不相关&quot;这类无法审查的自由文本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>剔除理由类别</th>\n<th>典型判据</th>\n<th>需保留的证据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>财务数据缺失</td>\n<td>收入或营业利润为空</td>\n<td>数据源导出快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规模不具可比性</td>\n<td>收入或资产低于门槛</td>\n<td>门槛设定依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务不相关</td>\n<td>行业代码或业务描述不符</td>\n<td>业务描述摘录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联方载体</td>\n<td>自身从事大量关联交易</td>\n<td>关联交易占比数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特殊状态</td>\n<td>亏损异常、重组、新设</td>\n<td>财报附注摘录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并口径不可比</td>\n<td>报告币种或口径不一致</td>\n<td>口径转换说明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行常被忽略：<strong>合并口径不可比</strong>。把集团合并报表的公司与单体公司放在一个样本里比利润率，结论是无效的，但这类错误在样本构建中相当常见。</p>\n<h3 id=\"剔除顺序的影响\">剔除顺序的影响</h3><p>筛选步骤的先后顺序会影响最终样本。先剔规模再剔业务，与先剔业务再剔规模，得到的结果可能不同——因为不同步骤的判据在边界情况上会互相作用。因此重放记录必须包含<strong>步骤编号</strong>（即上表中的 <code>screen_step</code>），这样税务机关重放时才能得到逐步骤一致的中间结果。只记录最终名单而丢失中间步骤，等于放弃了可重放性的一半。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差异调整的计量\">差异调整的计量</h2><p>找到可比对象只是开始，差异调整才是真正体现专业性的部分。常见需要调整的差异包括：会计政策差异（折旧方法、存货计价、研发资本化）、功能差异（是否承担研发、是否有自有品牌）、以及营运资本差异。</p>\n<h3 id=\"货币时间价值调整\">货币时间价值调整</h3><p>营运资本差异的调整值得单独说明，因为它有明确的计量方法：不同可比公司的应收账款、存货、应付账款水平不同，导致实际占用的营运资本不同，进而影响资本的账面回报。标准做法是计算各方的营运资本占收入比例，与测试方的差额按短期融资成本折算为利润调整。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Adj = (WC_{target} - WC_{comp}) \\times r_{financing}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">inan</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为营运资本占收入比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{financing}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">inan</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为适用的短期融资利率。这个调整看似简单，但<strong>利率的选择本身需要依据</strong>——通常引用同期同币种的市场利率，并留档来源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"调整的可靠性边界\">调整的可靠性边界</h3><p>法规明确：重大差异在被可靠识别与调整时应当调整，无法可靠调整时应降低该可比对象的可靠性（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/26/1.482-1\">26 CFR § 1.482-1</a>）。这意味着存在一个判断：<strong>某项差异能否被可靠调整</strong>。抗辩中需要显式声明的正是这个判断——哪些差异调整了、哪些没调整、以及为什么没调整的差异被认为不重大或可通过其他方式处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见抗辩主张及其证据要求\">常见抗辩主张及其证据要求</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抗辩主张</th>\n<th>所需证据</th>\n<th>强度评价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方法选择合理</td>\n<td>多方法对比的可靠性分析</td>\n<td>强，但需数据支撑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本可比性可靠</td>\n<td>完整筛选记录与版本</td>\n<td>强，前提是可重放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差异已充分调整</td>\n<td>每项调整的计量与依据</td>\n<td>中，取决于调整可靠性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果落入区间</td>\n<td>完整的统计计算过程</td>\n<td>中，区间宽度影响说服力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>亏损有商业理由</td>\n<td>集团层面数据与市场证据</td>\n<td>弱，除非有强外部证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地实体确实简单</td>\n<td>功能清单与人员资产数据</td>\n<td>中，需与集团数据一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行需要特别注意：抗辩&quot;本地实体确实简单&quot;与集团层面的价值链叙述必须一致。若主体文档把本地描述为价值链的关键环节，本地却主张自己是简单执行方，两者无法同时成立（一致性要求见 <a href=\"../beps-three-tier-doc/intercompany-pricing-doc-link\">内部定价与文档一致性</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"独立交易区间的抗辩含义\">独立交易区间的抗辩含义</h2><p>区间不是免责区。落区间只说明该年度结果可接受，不排除方法选择本身被质疑，也不排除税务机关主张样本质量不足而改用更宽的调整权。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def range_defense_strength(sample):&#10;    n = len(sample)&#10;    width = sample.p75 - sample.p25&#10;    median = sample.p50&#10;    rel_width = width / median if median else float(&quot;inf&quot;)&#10;    flags = []&#10;    if n &lt; 8:&#10;        flags.append(&quot;sample_too_small&quot;)&#10;    if rel_width &gt; 0.5:&#10;        flags.append(&quot;range_too_wide&quot;)&#10;    if sample.has_unadjusted_material_differences:&#10;        flags.append(&quot;unadjusted_differences&quot;)&#10;    return {&quot;flags&quot;: flags, &quot;defensible&quot;: not flags, &quot;rel_width&quot;: round(rel_width, 3)}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> range_defense_strength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sample):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sample)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sample.p75 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sample.p25</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    median </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sample.p50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rel_width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> median </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> median </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"inf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    flags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        flags.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sample_too_small\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rel_width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        flags.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"range_too_wide\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sample.has_unadjusted_material_differences:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        flags.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unadjusted_differences\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"flags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: flags, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"defensible\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flags, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rel_width\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rel_width, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三条判据对应的是抗辩中最常被质疑的三点：<strong>样本规模是否足以支撑统计区间</strong>、<strong>区间是否宽到失去说服力</strong>、<strong>是否存在未调整的重大差异</strong>。在正式提交前用这段逻辑自查，可以在税务机关提出之前发现弱点并补充证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可比性证据是一条三层依赖链：方法选择依据、样本产生过程、差异调整与区间；任一层断裂都会削弱后续论证。</li>\n<li>样本筛选必须可重放，需要固定数据源与版本、检索条件、以及逐条剔除理由；剔除理由应编码化而非自由文本。</li>\n<li>差异调整的可靠性是关键判断；无法可靠调整的差异应降低该可比对象的可靠性，并在文档中显式说明。</li>\n<li>营运资本等差异有明确计量方法，但调整所用利率的市场来源需要留档。</li>\n<li>区间不是免责区；样本规模、区间宽度、未调整差异是抗辩中三项最常被质疑的要点。</li>\n<li>抗辩主张必须与集团层面的价值链叙述一致，否则两个版本无法同时成立。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可比性分析与抗辩证据","id":"可比性分析与抗辩证据"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：证据链的三个层次","id":"核心概念-证据链的三个层次"},{"level":2,"text":"样本筛选的可重放记录","id":"样本筛选的可重放记录"},{"level":3,"text":"筛选日志的表结构","id":"筛选日志的表结构"},{"level":3,"text":"剔除顺序的影响","id":"剔除顺序的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"差异调整的计量","id":"差异调整的计量"},{"level":3,"text":"货币时间价值调整","id":"货币时间价值调整"},{"level":3,"text":"调整的可靠性边界","id":"调整的可靠性边界"},{"level":2,"text":"常见抗辩主张及其证据要求","id":"常见抗辩主张及其证据要求"},{"level":2,"text":"独立交易区间的抗辩含义","id":"独立交易区间的抗辩含义"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"转让定价稽查调查应对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/transfer-pricing-tax-audit-defense/tax-audit-defense/tp-audit-investigation-response"},"next":{"title":"纳税调整与双重征税消除","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/transfer-pricing-tax-audit-defense/tax-audit-defense/adjustment-double-tax-relief"}}